# --- Your content stays local ------------------------------------------------
# This repo is a reusable tool. Your own novels (copyrighted source + your
# translations) are git-ignored by default, so cloning, running, and adding
# novels never commits anyone else's work. Only the bundled demo ships.
# If you WANT to version your own novels in a private fork, delete these two
# lines (or add a matching `!novels/<your-novel>` exception).
novels/*
!novels/sample-novel

# --- Local benchmark corpora and outputs (copyrighted) stay local -----------
# Source chapters, official reference translations, and generated candidate
# translations for real-world benchmarks (e.g. Lord of Mysteries) are never
# committed. Only public benchmark CODE (scripts/benchmark.py), manifests
# (benchmarks/<id>/manifest.yaml), and aggregate result summaries live in the repo.
.local/

# Local config (may hold API keys / model choices)
config.yaml

# Secrets
.env
*.key

# Pipeline scratch: assembled prompts + handoff responses
.runs/

# Context-extraction proposals awaiting review
**/context/_proposals/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
